      "settings": {
        "replo_text_4f45ffef-9fbb-4403-ab3f-8c07a784bf99": "<p>VALENTINE'S DAY SALE</p>",
        "replo_text_de4950a0-37d8-40e6-9e77-ba673284de5d": "<p>Unique and Storied, Just Like the Men We Craft Them For</p>",
        "replo_text_19dfc126-a3c5-4617-97fe-6366ee9d4d48": "<p>100,000+ Happy Customers</p>",
        "replo_text_32d3b45f-817d-47a4-aa5f-5df7ca87524d": "<p>LEARN MORE</p>",
        "replo_text_63fcdde6-e36d-40af-a21e-28f893bd56f7": "<p>MEN'S RINGS & WEDDING BANDS</p>",
        "replo_text_5f6b9cd2-1f4d-4609-9995-273ced037d4a": "<p>Handcrafted | Lifetime Guarantee| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">SHOP NOW</span></p>",
        "replo_text_08e24507-dc0b-446f-b3c5-387641f3d2ca": "<p>VALENTINE'S SALE | UP TO 20% OFF</p>",
        "replo_text_2b14da58-5b1c-4677-8962-5d612d91b5c8": "<p>A Story in Ever Ring</p>",
        "replo_text_d28ba243-d3e4-4230-abbc-e4758b0d4d23": "<p>1</p>",
        "replo_text_7a17ec73-f7ac-4e40-9765-9eb3ff4116d3": "<p>Patrick Adair Designs rings are handcrafted to last a life time, featuring our \"perfect fit\" guarantee and an array of extraordinary materials. From aerospace grade titanium to virtually indestructible tungsten, each ring is a masterpiece of style and comfort.</p>",
        "replo_text_efc13fb7-ec89-4e6e-823e-0b6ab836b9be": "<p>Unique Designs. Perfect Fit. </p>",
        "replo_text_62f1bc53-a9fa-4360-a580-ddb4df3bf3f0": "<p>2</p>",
        "replo_text_890ab18b-308b-42a7-8d51-1f71a2bb1d49": "<p>Patrick Adair Designs rings are handcrafted to last a life time, featuring our \"perfect fit\" guarantee and an array of extraordinary materials. From aerospace grade titanium to virtually indestructible tungsten, each ring is a masterpiece of style and comfort.</p>",
        "replo_text_333686dd-d65d-4db5-98d8-b1988bc8b3be": "<p>Always Have a Backup Ring.</p>",
        "replo_text_ef3da6c9-f24f-44bc-954e-f20785a83660": "<p>3</p>",
        "replo_text_c01eb818-ae2f-4333-a867-1bee5ce6e3c0": "<p>Handcrafted.</p>",
        "replo_text_2095ea86-cbbf-40e2-9d7b-f9d30db9ad81": "<p>4</p>",
        "replo_text_51bde416-a8ed-4339-8a2c-486fcfd7df6c": "<p>Most jewelry is mass produced by machines overseas. Not ours. Every Patrick Adair ring is handcrafted start to finish by trained artisans. This ensures your ring is a one-of-a-kind luxury piece. </p>",
        "replo_text_7823db62-18f9-4b71-9aec-ab7b104faba5": "<p>Dozens of Materials. Hundreds of Designs. </p>",
        "replo_text_be77b138-5220-4352-b788-f5f0ce7feadc": "<p>5</p>",
        "replo_text_ca147762-6e1c-45ce-8c75-c99fcc6cef33": "<p>100% Satisfaction Guaranteed. </p>",
        "replo_text_08a70499-c059-4137-be23-344315f7fc69": "<p>6</p>",
        "replo_text_7a2a670e-2476-435f-90a2-ef9f2d2ec099": "<p>We promise you'll love your ring. If not, we guarantee we'll help you find a solution. We aren't happy until your happy. </p>",
        "replo_text_186f1649-12f6-4ef5-a975-2878a8946df3": "<p>WHAT THEY’re saying</p>",
        "replo_text_8cb1a8a9-05a4-4ddc-a5e3-ab04fc6c883b": "<p>“The best wallet I’ve ever owned. From the unique design to the fit and finish of the product, I am thoroughly impressed.”</p>",
        "replo_text_f03f43eb-7e65-486a-a8af-8cd17b3425c9": "<p>Joseph. Verified Ridge Customer</p>",
        "replo_text_33e2c4b5-d83b-445a-92bf-deec9ae086a8": "<p>“I'm 100% Satisfied. Over 3 months in, I’ve been stoked about everything about this wallet the entire time.”</p>",
        "replo_text_61beb45e-9723-44cc-8f93-81aaf9fcc1e3": "<p>Jesse. Verified Ridge Customer</p>",
        "replo_text_c6e7860f-feb1-42f2-8944-ebfb312727fe": "<p>“This wallet has been a game changer for me which is why it sparks such joy everytime I pick it up and it reminds me how much simpler things are now.”</p>",
        "replo_text_1dda6316-ad71-488e-bf44-742d6da3eda3": "<p>Danver. Verified Ridge Customer</p>",
        "replo_text_a1499166-c5a2-471f-9039-54db5f138bac": "<p>“Instantly was satisfied with how comfortable it was when carrying it in my front pocket and the minimal space it consumed for my EDC.”</p>",
        "replo_text_cefdb93b-6483-400d-8294-89c37c2d4148": "<p>Justin. Verified Ridge Customer</p>",
        "replo_text_7330beba-a21b-4065-8cd6-b4740364bd0a": "<p>“I love this wallet and highly recommend it. I've had it for over a month now and I wouldn't replace it with any other wallet.”</p>",
        "replo_text_a55339bf-036a-439e-ab9d-c35ba8501534": "<p>James. Verified Ridge Customer</p>",
